// v1.x) with 32 MB in-package PSRAM, MIPI-DSI and CSI (2 lanes each), USB 2.0 high speed, SD/MMC,
// Ethernet MAC, H.264 and JPEG, no radio; QFN-104 10 x 10 mm
// Compiled from the part sheet `parts/ESP32_P4NRW32.json` (`parts.create`); status: checked.
// Datasheet: https://documentation.espressif.com/esp32-p4-chip-revision-v1.3_datasheet_en.pdf
// (v1.2)
// Pins: Espressif ESP32-P4 Series Datasheet v1.2 (chip revision v1.3), Table 2-1 Pin Overview
// Footprint: the datasheet's land pattern
// This file may be used, changed and shared without conditions, with the board or alone.

use ./W25Q128JVSIQ as W25Q128JVSIQ

// Note: Chip revision v1.x parts (ESP32-P4NRW32) are end of life; their successors
// (ESP32-P4NRW32X, revision v3.x) need images built for v3.
// Note: GPIO35 high at reset boots from flash (low: download mode); GPIO37/38 are the ROM console
// UART0.

